  "ruleText": "Csp 301.06 Participation Agreement. The declaration of trust shall provide for a form of participation agreement that requires a participant to agree to the terms of the trust.\n\nSource. #7083, eff 8-26-99, EXPIRED: 8-26-07\n\nNew. #9585, eff 11-2-09; ss by #11097, eff 5-17-16 (formerly Csp 301.05); ss by #13302, eff 12-10-21",
